# Nav2-internal path preparation, not a motion command or permission.
# Only an actual progress failure after attempt_started is recoverable.
# Only the exact post-failure path may consume the one-shot preparation.
builtin_interfaces/Time attempt_started
nav_msgs/Path path
bool inspect_only
builtin_interfaces/Time task_started
---
bool prepared
string reason
bool matched
bool recoverable
bool waiting
uint64 progress_epoch
